<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian soybean and product market.</title>
<headline>Brazilian soybean and product market.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers reported the following Brazilian soybean, products basis levels.</p>
<p>(NS-no seller T-Trade P-Premium D-Discount NB-no bidder)</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean (cents per bushel)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> July		25/15 D	July	    20/10 D</p>
<p> August	    35/50 P	August	  35/50 P</p>
<p> Sept	     90/110 P	Sept	   95/110 P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soymeal/Pellets (dollars per short tonne 48 pct profat)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> July		20/18 D	July	    25/20 D</p>
<p> August	  17/14.5 D	August	  19/18 D</p>
<p> Sept	     NB/4.5 D	Sept	   EVEN/1 P</p>
<p> Oct		 19/18 D	Oct	     16/19 P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	 BASIS	   MONTH	  PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean Oil (dollars per tonne, points per lb, crude, degummed)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> July	    140/180 P	 July	 140/180 P</p>
<p> August	  140/160 P	 August     140/160 P</p>
<p> Sept	    110/140 P	 Sept	 120/170 P</p>
<p> Oct	     110/140 P	 Oct	  120/150 P</p>
